  body: "# Death benefit in retained PB and MDB guidance\n\n## Authored interpretation\n\nThe retained old-scheme
    guidance describes a lump sum for specified dependants, with disease, death-date, pre-1948 employment and compensation
    conditions.\n\n## Scope and exceptions\n\nThis is not the BSP or general Bereavement Benefit regime and is not
    a newly opened claim route. All historical scheme, dependant and compensation conditions require legal review
    in the context of the 2012 abolition/transfer statement.\n\n## Inspected passages\n\n- [DMG 73412, PDF page
    9](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a8019b540f0b62305b892c3/dmgch73.pdf#page=9).\n- [DMG 73413,
    PDF page 9](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a8019b540f0b62305b892c3/dmgch73.pdf#page=9).\n\n\
    ## Evidence and review status\n\nIndependent experimental interpretation of captured DWP guidance, not an official
    DWP document. Definitions and semantic associations are model-assisted proposals awaiting specialist review.
    No individual entitlement decision, medical conclusion, award calculation or executable rule is provided.\n\n\
    Source observation, listing-page update, printed revision, legal event and claimant-event dates are separate.
    Current legal applicability is unresolved. Page numbers are one-based PDF positions; machine extraction may
    damage reading order, characters and footnotes. No visual PDF or specialist acceptance is claimed.\n\n- `dmg-vol11-ch73`:
    PDF `3b17129736cf09e79f9df7079d4a83c4c2b74676d356c2c92947ef6cb12839ba`; extracted pages `d3ddd9b78f348565850afeafbaecd17ef9937905318211d171770a38ceadd7a3`;
    acquired `2026-09-15T19:45:34.331056Z`.\n"
  resource: https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a8019b540f0b62305b892c3/dmgch73.pdf#page=9
