        byssinosis3 or\n                      Scheduled disease 1 or 24 or\n\n              2.2     27.7.67 - where
        the relevant disease is one of Scheduled diseases 3 -\n                      55 (except where 2.7a applies)
        or\n\n              2.3     27.5.69 - where the relevant disease is Scheduled disease 66 or\n\n        \
        \      2.4     8.8.79 - where the relevant disease is Scheduled disease 77 or\n\n              2.5     1.4.85
        - where the relevant disease is Sheduled disease 88 or\n\n              2.6     1.4.87 - where the relevant
        disease is Scheduled disease 99 or\n\n              2.7     24.6.93 - where the relevant disease is10\n\n\
        \                      2.7.a      Scheduled disease 4 and the nature of the occupation is that\n       \
        \                          shown at (d) in the right hand column of Appendix 1 to this\n               \
        \                  Chapter or\n\n                      2.7.b      Scheduled disease 10 and\n\n        3.\
        \    the deceased had been employed before 5.7.48\n\n              3.1     in an occupation scheduled for
        the relevant disease and\n\n              3.2     that occupation was scheduled before the date of death11
        and\n\n        4.    the deceased had not been entitled to compensation as set out in DMG 73332\n      \
